    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;be unit vectors. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;be a vector such that the angle between <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>12</mn></mfrac></math>, and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is equal to:",
